            "review_title": "Review at Lam Dien Restaurant",
            "review_text": "mriek b\n4 contributions\n0\nDinner with Family & Friends\nSep 2024 • Family\nIts an amazing restaurant with great food and beverages.\nThe dinner was delicious with wonderful service and attentive staff.\nWe had some spicy and sweet started with our drinks, must recommend the battered corn kernals.\nFor dinner, we had a mix of western cuisine (Caesar Salad, Cheeseburgers), traditional Vietnamese street food (Fried Spring Rolls) and the famous noodles with seafood and beef!\nDesert was a moist Tiramisu that the Italians would be proud of!\nWe would expect a few more dessert options as there was only a choice of 4.\nThe only additional feedback wouldnbe it needs a kids menu for our children.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 21, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
