            "review_title": "Review at Lam Dien Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kamila B\n1 contribution\n0\nWholesome lunch with friends\nSep 2024 • Family\nThis restaurant is great for a casual lunch with my friends.\nIt has traditional Vietnamese cuisine including Hanoi Street food as well as a vast range of Western food options which include delicious burgers, pizza and club sandwiches.\nWe had some mulberry wine including these traditional Vietnamese Pork and Onion Biscuits.\nWe will no doubt be coming again for dinner!\nThank you\nKamila\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2024",
